Python Control Flow :
Title: Create List in python

Concept:
Lists are ordered and mutable collections.
They can contain mixed data types (string, integer, float, etc.).
Created using square brackets [].

Tech used :
Language : pyhton
Compiler : Visual Studio Code

Logic Flow:
friends stores multiple values inside brackets.
print(friends) outputs the entire list.

Input :
friends = ['suriya', 'yazhi', 'sangeetha', 1, 5]
print(friends)

Output :
['suriya', 'yazhi', 'sangeetha', 1, 5]
